alter_tablespace     : DISCARD/IMPORT TABLESPACE not supported
autoinc_secondary    : Auto-increment on secondary column of composite PK has different gap behavior
checksum_table_live  : CHECKSUM TABLE QUICK/LIVE not supported (EXTENDED works)
delete_low_prio      : Table-level lock priority not supported
foreign_keys         : Foreign key constraints not supported
fulltext_search      : FULLTEXT indexes not supported
handler              : HANDLER command not supported
index_enable_disable : DISABLE/ENABLE KEYS not supported
insert_delayed       : INSERT DELAYED not supported
insert_high_prio     : Table-level lock priority not supported
insert_low_prio      : Table-level lock priority not supported
lock                 : LOCK TABLES blocking semantics not supported
lock_concurrent      : LOCK TABLES blocking semantics not supported
repair_table         : REPAIR TABLE not supported
select_high_prio     : Table-level lock priority not supported
truncate_table       : Test uses HANDLER command which is not supported
type_spatial         : Spatial types not supported
type_spatial_indexes : Spatial indexes not supported
update_low_prio      : Table-level lock priority not supported
